%%{init: {'theme': 'default', 'themeVariables': { 'fontFamily': 'Inter' }}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Sensores Ambientales
    participant GM as Gateway Manager
    participant DS as Data Storage
    participant CLS as Water Stress Classifier
    participant IPS as Irrigation Prediction Service
    participant RM as Recommendation Manager
    participant OP as Operador (User/Vis)
    participant ACS as Actuator Control Service
    participant CRM as Conflict Resolution Manager
    participant DC as Device Communication
    participant V as Válvulas
    participant AL as Audit Logging

    Note over S,V: Flujo de Telemetría e Inferencia
    S->>GM: Mediciones crudas
    GM->>DS: ItelemetrySync.publishTelemetry()
    DS->>CLS: IanalyticsContext.fetchContext()
    DS->>IPS: IanalyticsContext.fetchContext()
    CLS-->>RM: IanalyticsResult.emitAnalysis()
    IPS-->>RM: IanalyticsResult.emitAnalysis()
    
    Note over RM,OP: Ciclo de Aprobación Humana
    RM->>OP: IhumanApproval.proposeRecommendation()
    OP-->>RM: IhumanApproval.submitDecision()
    
    alt Decisión: Aceptar/Modificar
        RM->>ACS: IcommandRequest.requestActuation()
        ACS->>CRM: IcommandValidation.validatePriority()
        CRM-->>ACS: IcommandValidation.resolveConflict()
        ACS->>GM: IcommandExecution.dispatchCommand()
        GM->>DC: IvalveControl.executeActuatorCommand()
        DC-->>V: Comando físico (apertura/cierre)
    end

    Note over GM,CRM: Sincronización Post-Desconexión
    alt Sin Conectividad
        GM->>GM: Reglas críticas locales (<3s)
        GM->>GM: Cola persistente local
    end
    
    Note over GM,DS: Reconciliación
    GM->>DS: ItelemetrySync.syncOfflineQueue()
    DS->>CRM: Fusión de órdenes (Vector Clock + nonce)
    CRM-->>DS: Orden unificada / Descarte duplicado [REQ-C07]

    Note over All,AL: Trazabilidad
    loop Cada Interfaz
        GM->>AL: IauditTrail.logDecision()
        DS->>AL: IauditTrail.logExecution()
        RM->>AL: IauditTrail.logDecision()
        ACS->>AL: IauditTrail.logExecution()
    end